msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_esp01/08-iot_Bluetooth_lock_controller.rst:227
msgid "The ``loop()`` function runs repeatedly. It reads incoming messages from the Bluetooth module. If the message is '1', the servo is moved to the \"locked\" position, and if the message is '0', the servo is moved to the \"unlocked\" position. The current status (\"Locked\" or \"Unlocked\") is printed to the Serial Monitor."
msgstr ""
